        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Accordingly, we maintain engineering relationships with various hardware manufacturers, and we develop our software in tandem with their product development.",
        "start_character": 9859,
        "end_character": 10016
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-007087",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-007087-96a15ee674a190b1",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-007087",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Because of our broad product portfolio, deep integration and product development experience and flexible business models we can quickly bring to market innovative solutions that support our customers’ needs, which create new revenue opportunities for our customers and differentiates their products and services from their competitors.",
        "start_character": 7768,
        "end_character": 8103
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-007087",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-007087-96a15ee674a190b1",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-007087",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In our business, we market and sell our products primarily to large MNOs and MSOs, so there are a limited number of actual and potential customers for our current products, resulting in significant customer concentration.",
        "start_character": 8830,
        "end_character": 9051
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-007087",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-007087-96a15ee674a190b1",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-007087",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide technical support and customer service through our online knowledge base, email, and live chat.",
        "start_character": 9188,
        "end_character": 9294
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-007087",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-007087-96a15ee674a190b1",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-007087",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "The Company provides various training and development opportunities to foster an environment in which employees are encouraged to be creative thinkers who are driven, focused, and interested and able to advance their knowledge and skills in ever-changing technology.",
        "start_character": 14116,
        "end_character": 14382
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-007087",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-007087-96a15ee674a190b1",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-007087",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "The markets in which we operate are highly competitive and subject to rapid changes in technology.",
        "start_character": 10270,
        "end_character": 10368
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-007087",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-007087-96a15ee674a190b1",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-007087",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We launched SafePath Kids in 2024 as a new and innovative implementation of our solution, which enables MNOs to offer rate plans for children with built-in protections, and in 2025 we launched SafePathOS, a software solution designed to be pre-installed and configured on mobile devices to enable MNOs to offer kids phones and senior phones with key features and protections of our SafePath family safety solution out of the box.",
        "start_character": 5892,
        "end_character": 6321
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-007087",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-007087-96a15ee674a190b1",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-007087",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We remain focused on the development and expansion of our technology, particularly in the wireless space.",
        "start_character": 10152,
        "end_character": 10257
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-007087",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-007087-96a15ee674a190b1",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-007087",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "We also believe that the market for our software products has been and will continue to be characterized by significant price competition.",
        "start_character": 11163,
        "end_character": 11301
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-007087",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-007087-96a15ee674a190b1",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-007087",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "We believe that the principal competitive factors affecting the mobile software market include domain expertise, product features, usability, quality, price, customer service, speed to market and effective sales and marketing efforts.",
        "start_character": 10716,
        "end_character": 10950
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-007087",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-007087-96a15ee674a190b1",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-007087",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "These conditions create new opportunities for Smith Micro, as well as for our competitors, and we expect new competitors to continue to enter the market.",
        "start_character": 10369,
        "end_character": 10522
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-007087",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-007087-96a15ee674a190b1",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-007087",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "We are not subject to any collective bargaining agreement, and we believe that our relationships with our employees are good.",
        "start_character": 13757,
        "end_character": 13882
      }
